!! <$text text="WikiText"/> Table

```
<style>
.wide-column {
    width: 150px;
}
</style>

|caption text       |c
|my-table           |k
||>|>|Spanned Header|h
||Left|Center|Right|h
||wide-column  |<|<|g
|A|^top left    |^ top center    |^    top right|
|B|~|~|~|
|C|mid left     |   mid center   |     mid right|
|D|~|~|~|
|E|,bottom left |, bottom center |, bottom right|
|F|~|~|~|
|G|The footer appears at the bottom.        |<|<|f
|H|~|f
